  "notes": [
    "Merger proxies (DEFM14A) and tender offers (SC TO-T) are counted by filing date: a proxy is filed weeks or months after a deal is announced, so these are filings, not announcements.",
    "SPAC mergers are flagged (blank-check industry code, '... Acquisition Corp' names, warrant/unit tickers) and shown separately; amendments (e.g. SC TO-T/A) are not new deals and are left out.",
    "PE sponsors: sum of each firm's own SEC-registered advisers (Form ADV roster); joint ventures and unrelated name matches excluded. Private-fund gross assets is the ranking basis; summed RAUM can overlap between related advisers. Non-US sponsors (EQT, CVC, Partners Group) are largely not SEC-registered.",
    "Form D covers US exempt-offering notices only; not every fund files. 'Amount sold' sums new notices; offerings with an indefinite size are counted separately.",
    "Source: SEC EDGAR (full-text search, Form ADV, Form D data sets). Not investment advice."
  ]
